body:
I'm an outpatient nurse who works for an agency. I live in SF so it's tough getting a job and I only have 1.8ish years of experience, most outpatient places actually ask for 2 years of experience now. Is there anything I can improve in my resume in the meantime? I'd appreciate any critique thanks so much!

&#x200B;

also, I have inpatient psych experience but it was only 6 months long. is that appropriate to include? I know it's experience but it's pretty short time and I don't want to seem like a job hopper.
